    "handle": "@kaifulee",
    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/kaifulee",
    "time": "2026-06-18T08:25:40.000Z",
    "text": "Here is how I minimize sycophancy, capitulation, hallucinations, and guessing using Claude.  So many people complain about these, but they can largely be fixed by doing this:\n\nBelow is my prompt for Claude, which can be entered under Settings > General > Instructions for Claude.",
    "title": "Here is how I minimize sycophancy, capitulation, hallucinations, and guessing using Claude.",
