    "time": "2026-06-12T16:25:00.000Z",
    "text": "You have 9 days left of Fable 5, don't waste it.\n\nHere's my output-optimized Fable stack that doesn't burn tokens like crazy:\n\n[I explain the task]\n1. plan - high\n2. plan review - xhigh\n[human in the loop]\n3. implement - medium\n4. diff review - xhigh\n[human in the loop]\n\nI use 2",
