    "time": "2026-06-11T12:03:20.000Z",
    "text": "The Anatomy of a new Claude 'Fable 5' Prompt:\n\n1. Task\n\nStart with why, NOT what. \nClaude 5 connects the dots.\n'I'm working on [goal] for [who it's for]. They need [what the output enables]. With that in mind: [task].'\n\n2. Context Files\n\nUpload your expertise. Stop explaining in",
