    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/LocasaleLab",
    "time": "2026-06-01T15:49:01.000Z",
    "text": "After decades of work and billions of dollars, this is what passes for a revolution in cancer research.\n\nThis drug is being hyped to no end on social media. At the oncology conference, there is a standing ovation from a crowd of 40,000 doctors and industry people celebrating it",
