    "text": "\"Writing is thinking.\" This phrase went viral recently (from https://lnkd.in/gYj2c9uE), often quoted in the context of objections to use of AI in drafting academic prose. In Nature Reviews Bioengineering we respond: \"Thinking is not only writing.\" Preview below. Shareable full",
