    "text": "Codex as a spaced repetition reading partner.\n\nI tell it what chapter I'm reading (it reads the relevant section of the PDF) I can ask questions and bounce back ideas and after the session, quizzes me and proposes anki cards according to the 20 rules of formulating knowledge.",
