    "handle": "@jonnym1ller",
    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/jonnym1ller",
    "time": "2026-04-25T01:25:12.000Z",
    "text": "I think @drmichaellevin's work is some of the most important science being explored today.\n\nFor fun, I had my agent build a 'bioelectric wiki', compiling his 330+ studies, summarizing core claims, key concepts & generate 22 testable novel hypothesis.\n\n→ http://jonnymiller.co/levin",
