    "time": "2026-04-24T04:07:55.000Z",
    "text": "The biggest problem for beginners to learn any technology is \"Tutorial Hell\".\n\nIf you don't have a clear plan on what topics you want to learn then it is easy to get lost while going from one blog/video to another.\n\nI have created an Agent Skill to prepare a study plan so that",
