    "time": "2026-04-24T02:08:12.000Z",
    "text": "MIT 6.041 Probability: Counting\nThis lecture made a useful connection click for me.\n\nPermutations and binomial coefficients can feel like separate formulas to   memorize. \nBut once outcomes are equally likely, probability becomes a counting problem. \n\nWhat made it clearer was n",
