    "text": "Must-listen interview by @Changxche with ex-ByteDance AI researcher:\n- Benchmaxxing\n- Distillation on US models\n- Poor data quality and infra\n- Compute constraints\n\n\"I don’t even agree with the assumption that Chinese models are catching up — I believe we’re still far behind. I",
