    "handle": "@nlarusstone",
    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/nlarusstone",
    "time": "2026-04-23T14:48:08.000Z",
    "text": "Lot of talk on here about building an \"AI Scientist\", but not a lot of discussion about what an AI Scientist actually does.\n\nSo we wrote the guide:",
    "title": "Lot of talk on here about building an \"AI Scientist\", but not a lot of discussion about what an AI Scientist…",
