    "text": "First big unlock from vibe science-ing: rapid access to publicly available datasets. Sounds basic. It isn't. \nIf you've ever tried to pull raw data from a paper you care about, you know: the metadata is a mess, the supplementary tables are unstructured, the file formats don't",
