    "time": "2026-04-17T22:00:36.000Z",
    "text": "Lifestyle and following evidence-based research is more important.\n\nStay active, avoid alcohol, sleep, minimize stress, and eat more fruit and plants.\n\nIt’s not always easy to follow, but small steps compound.",
