    "time": "2026-04-16T10:34:51.000Z",
    "text": "Hot take: AI hypothesis generation gets the headlines. AI lab robots get the demos. Meanwhile, computational biology/bioinformatics is quietly doing more for actual scientific output than either. \n\nAside from protein structure predictions, nobody set out to revolutionize",
