    "time": "2026-04-04T16:45:23.000Z",
    "text": "Wow, this tweet went very viral!\n\nI wanted share a possibly slightly improved version of the tweet in an \"idea file\". The idea of the idea file is that in this era of LLM agents, there is less of a point/need of sharing the specific code/app, you just share the idea, then the",
