    "text": "I highly recommend all phd students (esp those starting their academic career) to read up this amazing slides / tips for students by @EugeneVinitsky \n\nthat community / collaboration part is so underdiscussed, and Eugene's tips resonated with my experience\n\n(link in thread)",
