    "id": "x-1989314287622393914",
    "author": "Prof. Nikolai Slavov",
    "handle": "@slavov_n",
    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/slavov_n",
    "time": "2025-11-14T12:47:40.000Z",
    "text": "Dimensionality reduction can see structures that do not exist and miss structures that exist.  \n\n𝐓𝐡𝐞 𝐬𝐢𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐞𝐬𝐭 𝐞𝐱𝐩𝐥𝐚𝐧𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐢𝐬𝐧’𝐭 𝐚𝐥𝐰𝐚𝐲𝐬 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐛𝐞𝐬𝐭 𝐨𝐧𝐞.  \n\n1/n",
    "title": "Dimensionality reduction can see structures that do not exist and miss structures that exist.",
    "source": "X / Twitter",
