    "id": "x-2013040231193157713",
    "author": "Nikunj Kothari",
    "handle": "@nikunj",
    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/nikunj",
    "time": "2026-01-19T00:06:06.000Z",
    "text": "Because Skills are just text files you can continuously (or dare I say recursively) keep training them..\n\nFor example, I have a rather in depth skill that explains how to do research and how to use it to write cold emails in my voice. \n\nHowever every time it outputs one, I",
    "title": "Because Skills are just text files you can continuously (or dare I say recursively) keep training them..",
    "source": "X / Twitter",
    "platform": "X",
