    "time": "2026-01-14T19:21:00.000Z",
    "text": "Skills? MCPs? Workflows? Rules? It's a lot. But we're all experimenting live with different ways to shape AI dev workflows. It's going to be messy for a bit.\n\nI really liked @iRomin's tutorial on @antigravity Skills, and how to distinguish the techniques.\nhttps://medium.com/google-cloud/tutorial-getting-started-with-antigravity-skills-864041811e0d…",
