    "time": "2025-11-26T16:28:15.000Z",
    "text": "MIT provides Mahajan's books online for free!\n1. https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/res-6-011-the-art-of-insight-in-science-and-engineering-mastering-complexity-fall-2014/3bca850386a3005c22134fa62fb3bad5_MITRES_6-011F14_art_insfin.pdf…\n2. https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/18-098-street-fighting-mathematics-january-iap-2008/d937ad2ca4b7839a5b3bd92e30ee483e_MIT18_098IAP08_draft_text.pdf…\n\nPolya's book is also available for free:\nhttps://hlevkin.com/hlevkin/90MathPhysBioBooks/Math/Polya/George_Polya_How_To_Solve_It_.pdf…\n\nFor physics, a good place to start is here:\nhttps://andrew.cmu.edu/user/bbji/Desktop/University%20Physics%20with%20Modern%20Physics%2015th%20Edition%20By%20Hugh%20D.%20Young_compressed.pdf…\n\nFor math (assuming you know up to Calc II),",
