    "text": "You’re using NotebookLM wrong.\n\nHere’s the right way to extract maximum value:\n\n  1. Create a notebook for ONE topic\n  2. Upload 10–50 sources\n  3. Use deep research to expand your library\n  4. Ask questions only based on sources\n  5. Save the best answers as notes\n  6. Convert",
