    "author": "Mark Worrall",
    "handle": "@infinitehumanai",
    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/infinitehumanai",
    "time": "2025-11-25T14:35:42.000Z",
    "text": "How are those 80 hours distributed? That matters a lot.\n\nI think it's pretty unrealistic to be pushing hard for 80 hours a week, but being on or present for that long is a different question.\n\nI’m also pretty wary of the hustle-culture mythos that glorifies big-hour weeks. If",
    "title": "How are those 80 hours distributed?",
