    "id": "x-1990577951671509438",
    "author": "Andrej Karpathy",
    "handle": "@karpathy",
    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/karpathy",
    "time": "2025-11-18T00:29:01.000Z",
    "text": "I’m starting to get into a habit of reading everything (blogs, articles, book chapters,…) with LLMs. Usually pass 1 is manual, then pass 2 “explain/summarize”, pass 3 Q&A. I usually end up with a better/deeper understanding than if I moved on. Growing to among top use cases.\n\nOn",
