    "text": "how to research; properly.\n\nmost people “google and scroll.” real researchers hunt, map, and build.\nhere’s the generalized approach that actually works; in any field:\n\n1. start with a question, not a topic.\n“how can we make small drones navigate indoors?” is better than “indoor",
