    "time": "2024-10-30T16:27:01.000Z",
    "text": "What's the threshold for hardcore math skills?\n\nJust spitballing here, maybe: full automaticity on all the topics that you'd cover in an engineering degree at an elite university.\n\nOf course you'd want to combine that with hardcore coding skills too.\n\nWhat's the threshold for",
