    "handle": "@alanchan_tw",
    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/alanchan_tw",
    "time": "2025-09-26T08:17:30.000Z",
    "text": "The most underrated use of AI isn’t learning faster—it’s becoming capable of learning knowledge that’s deeper, harder, and more abstract.\n\nIn this article, I share how I use AI to teach myself a textbook step by step, and why the gains in depth + quality have been mind-blowing.",
