    "time": "2025-09-25T19:25:54.000Z",
    "text": "You asked, I deliver (2 weeks late).\n\nA blogpost about what I did over the last 18 months to sign as a research engineer at a foundation model lab.\n\nLink and summary below\n\n1/n",
