    "time": "2025-09-13T19:02:00.000Z",
    "text": "Time is the #1 killer of dreams and aspirations. When someone gives up on their dream, or gives up on figuring out what that dream is, it's typically a result of them losing the race against time. That is the point of compressing time, of removing skill bottlenecks early.",
