    "text": "I built a Claude Code hook so I can show changes instead of narrating them.\n\nAuto-snapshot repo after Claude runs → I edit → !claude-diff tells Claude what changed.\n\nYou avoid bloating the context window, or having to copy-paste changes when you want something done differently.",
