    "text": "I'm happy to inform you that you can now use Kimi K2 directly with Claude Code using my little claude-bridge tool via @GroqInc .\n\nLeft -> Claude, Right -> Kimi K2\n\nClaude still provides better answers and is cheaper. But K2 is quite fast (if the Groq servers aren't overloaded)",
