    "time": "2025-06-25T10:20:33.000Z",
    "text": "To understand a new codebase, my workflow:\n1. Convert the repo into markdown: https://repo2txt.simplebasedomain.com\n2. Feed that markdown into Google's AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat…\n\nCompletely free and 200% faster than letting Claude run amok eating tokens. Plus Gemini has a 1Mio context",
