    "time": "2025-03-22T23:04:47.000Z",
    "text": "TDLR; push hard, deliberate practice, don't overcomplicate, and be consistent.\n\nUsually, in everything I do, I try to push hard and don't overcomplicate things.\n\nIn terms of note-taking, I go back and forth between physical notebooks and Notion. It's very useful as a way to",
    "title": "TDLR; push hard, deliberate practice, don't overcomplicate, and be consistent.",
