    "time": "2025-03-06T09:07:03.000Z",
    "text": "Everyone recommends reading research papers, but few talk about how to do it effectively. Like any skill, it gets easier with time, but starting out can be daunting. It helps to know that the struggles you face are common, and that there are ways to overcome them.\n\nI wrote about",
