    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/justinskycak",
    "time": "2024-10-22T12:05:34.000Z",
    "text": "If you don't push yourself to perform beyond your level of comfort, you don't improve your performance. Simple as that.\n\nWhy? Because performance improvements come from your body adapting to additional strain. No strain, no gain.\n\nStrain can be unpleasant. It's taxing and it",
