    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/justinskycak",
    "time": "2024-10-09T20:31:20.000Z",
    "text": "A couple months ago I posted a 4-stage roadmap for going from high school math to cutting-edge ML/AI.\n\nStep 1, foundational math, we already have on @_MathAcademy_. \n\nStep 2, classical machine learning, is not yet on MA, but I'm going to start scoping out the new course tomorrow!",
