    "handle": "@Eric_Partaker",
    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/Eric_Partaker",
    "time": "2024-10-09T13:20:54.000Z",
    "text": "To-do lists are like cancer for productivity.\n \nHere’s the secret “Harvard” tool I use instead:",
    "title": "To-do lists are like cancer for productivity.",
