    "id": "x-1824504733832265973",
    "author": "Justin Skycak",
    "handle": "@justinskycak",
    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/justinskycak",
    "time": "2024-08-16T17:53:20.000Z",
    "text": "I haven't checked these out in too much depth, but here's some stuff I've seen that appears to cover coding using an approach that's similar in spirit to MA:\n\nhttps://launchschool.com\nhttps://executeprogram.com",
    "title": "I haven't checked these out in too much depth, but here's some stuff I've seen that appears to cover coding u…",
