    "time": "2024-09-23T03:31:16.000Z",
    "text": "thinking a little about the mid-long term implications of systems like mathacademy\n\nafter using it for a while i’m now fairly confident that if you took a normal student at a young enough age and gave them access they’d be graduate level in math before the age they’d normally",
