    "handle": "@justinskycak",
    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/justinskycak",
    "time": "2024-09-24T14:57:29.000Z",
    "text": "It would naturally generalize to math-adjacent fields like physics or mathy CS, and I would expect it to generalize further.\n\nI realize that as you move through CS, further away from math, courses typically become very project-heavy (for instance, many more projects in",
    "title": "It would naturally generalize to math-adjacent fields like physics or mathy CS, and I would expect it to gene…",
    "source": "X / Twitter",
