    "handle": "@hu_yifei",
    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/hu_yifei",
    "time": "2024-08-12T16:43:26.000Z",
    "text": "I really love these lectures from experienced researchers/engineers. Listening to people who are down-to-earth (real-world problems) is very enjoyable!\n(@giffmana on SigLip)",
    "title": "I really love these lectures from experienced researchers/engineers.",
