    "profileUrl": "https://x.com/mdredze",
    "time": "2023-12-20T15:26:27.000Z",
    "text": "Students often ask: How do you review PhD applications? What do you look for? Tell me the secrets behind the process!\n\nI made a video last year explaining how it all works. \n\nTo all PhD applicants: good luck with your graduate school search this year!",
