    "text": "In case you missed it, I find this a masterpiece\n\nCause and Effect in Biology | Science https://science.org/doi/10.1126/science.134.3489.1501… \n\nI think that misinterpretation of causality is one of the biggest problems in biology (and probably medicine.",
