    "time": "2023-07-18T03:55:52.000Z",
    "text": "I collected open code repositories for top big pharma and biotech companies using AI/ML heavily. Surprise-surprise, but 10 companies out of 26 big pharma do not have a centralized open code repository. https://github.com/chupvl/awesome-ls-ventures/blob/main/awesome-pharma-biotech-aiml.md…",
    "title": "I collected open code repositories for top big pharma and biotech companies using AI/ML heavily.",
