    "time": "2022-12-28T05:52:37.000Z",
    "text": "What are the thinking tools of the CREATIVE scientific process? In 'night science' we use analogies, find new questions, embrace contradictions, import/export ideas, improvise, explore the data & puzzle-switch. Here's a for more about it.\nhttps://biomedcentral.com/collections/night-science… @MartinJLercher",
